spell.aom-atlantean.aomCarnivoraSeed.des:
{Advanced Carnivora Seed}

Plants Carnivoras that fight for you until the end of the battle: their total Hit Points are Spell Power x 50 (60 Hit Points each).
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos or Gaia, summoned amount +25%.

{Basic Carnivora Seed}

Plants Carnivoras that fight for you until the end of the battle: their total Hit Points are Spell Power x 35 (60 Hit Points each).
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos or Gaia, summoned amount +25%.

{Expert Carnivora Seed}

Plants Carnivoras that fight for you until the end of the battle: their total Hit Points are Spell Power x 65 (60 Hit Points each).
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos or Gaia, summoned amount +25%.

