spell.aom-atlantean.aomGaiaForest.descri:
{Advanced Gaia Forest}

Grows a row of trees 3 hexes wide upwards from the target hex, blocking the way for 2 rounds.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Gaia, lasts one more round.

{Basic Gaia Forest}

Grows a row of trees 2 hexes wide upwards from the target hex, blocking the way for 2 rounds.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Gaia, lasts one more round.

{Expert Gaia Forest}

Grows a row of trees 3 hexes wide upwards from the target hex, blocking the way for 3 rounds.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Gaia, lasts one more round.

{Gaia Forest}

