{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Gaia, lasts one more round.

spell.aom-atlantean.aomReturnAtlantis.de:
{Advanced Return to Atlantis}

The sunken homeland answers the call: a stack of random Atlantean out-of-town myth units drops in on your side at once, and another stack follows at the start of every round until the battle ends.
The total Hit Points of each stack are Spell Power x 30, at least 1 creature. Can be cast only once per battle.

{Basic Return to Atlantis}

The sunken homeland answers the call: a stack of random Atlantean out-of-town myth units drops in on your side at once, and another stack follows at the start of every round until the battle ends.
The total Hit Points of each stack are Spell Power x 20, at least 1 creature. Can be cast only once per battle.

{Expert Return to Atlantis}

The sunken homeland answers the call: a stack of random Atlantean out-of-town myth units drops in on your side at once, and another stack follows at the start of every round until the battle ends.
The total Hit Points of each stack are Spell Power x 40, at least 1 creature. Can be cast only once per battle.

{Return to Atlantis}

The sunken homeland answers the call: a stack of random Atlantean out-of-town myth units drops in on your side at once, and another stack follows at the start of every round until the battle ends.
The total Hit Points of each stack are Spell Power x 20, at least 1 creature. Can be cast only once per battle.

spell.aom-atlantean.aomShockwave.descrip:
{Advanced Shockwave}

Enemy troops on the target hex and the hexes around it take (Spell Power x 8 + 20) damage and get -3 Speed for 1 round.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos, damage +25%.

{Basic Shockwave}

Enemy troops on the target hex and the hexes around it take (Spell Power x 8 + 10) damage and get -2 Speed for 1 round.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos, damage +25%.

{Expert Shockwave}

Enemy troops on the target hex and the hexes around it take (Spell Power x 8 + 40) damage and get -4 Speed for 2 rounds.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos, damage +25%.

{Shockwave}

Enemy troops on the target hex and the hexes around it take (Spell Power x 8 + 10) damage and get -2 Speed for 1 round.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos, damage +25%.

spell.aom-atlantean.aomSpiderLair.descri:
{Advanced Spider Lair}

Buries 3 spider lairs that the enemy cannot see on random empty hexes. A stack that steps on one is seized by a giant spider: it stops moving, takes (Spell Power x 12 + 60) damage and gets -3 Speed for 2 rounds.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Gaia, damage +25%.

{Basic Spider Lair}

Buries 2 spider lairs that the enemy cannot see on random empty hexes. A stack that steps on one is seized by a giant spider: it stops moving, takes (Spell Power x 12 + 30) damage and gets -3 Speed for 2 rounds.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Gaia, damage +25%.

{Expert Spider Lair}

Buries 4 spider lairs that the enemy cannot see on random empty hexes. A stack that steps on one is seized by a giant spider: it stops moving, takes (Spell Power x 12 + 120) damage and gets -3 Speed for 2 rounds.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Gaia, damage +25%.

{Spider Lair}

Buries 2 spider lairs that the enemy cannot see on random empty hexes. A stack that steps on one is seized by a giant spider: it stops moving, takes (Spell Power x 12 + 30) damage and gets -3 Speed for 2 rounds.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Gaia, damage +25%.

