{Advanced Tartarian Gate}

A Tartarian Gate bursts out of the ground on the target hex: all troops on the target hex and the hexes around it take (Spell Power x 12 + 30) fire damage, and Tartarian Spawn crawl out of the gate to fight for you: their total Hit Points are Spell Power x 30 (48 Hit Points each).
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos or Gaia, damage and summoned amount +25%.

{Basic Tartarian Gate}

A Tartarian Gate bursts out of the ground on the target hex: all troops on the target hex and the hexes around it take (Spell Power x 12 + 20) fire damage, and Tartarian Spawn crawl out of the gate to fight for you: their total Hit Points are Spell Power x 20 (48 Hit Points each).
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos or Gaia, damage and summoned amount +25%.

{Expert Tartarian Gate}

A Tartarian Gate bursts out of the ground on the target hex: all troops on the target hex and the hexes around it take (Spell Power x 12 + 40) fire damage, and Tartarian Spawn crawl out of the gate to fight for you: their total Hit Points are Spell Power x 40 (48 Hit Points each).
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Oranos or Gaia, damage and summoned amount +25%.

