spell.aom-atlantean.aomValor.description:
{Advanced Valor}

One friendly living stack recovers (Spell Power x 30 + 60) Hit Points (no resurrection) and fights like a hero: +3 Attack and Defense and +1 Speed, for a number of rounds equal to Spell Power.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Oranos, healing +25%.

{Basic Valor}

One friendly living stack recovers (Spell Power x 30 + 30) Hit Points (no resurrection) and fights like a hero: +2 Attack and Defense and +1 Speed, for a number of rounds equal to Spell Power.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Oranos, healing +25%.

{Expert Valor}

One friendly living stack recovers (Spell Power x 30 + 120) Hit Points (no resurrection) and fights like a hero: +4 Attack and Defense and +2 Speed, for a number of rounds equal to Spell Power.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Oranos, healing +25%.

{Valor}

