{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Oranos, healing +25%.

spell.aom-atlantean.aomVortex.descriptio:
{Advanced Vortex}

A vortex instantly sweeps the 3 friendly stacks nearest to the target hex to the hexes around it. War machines are not affected.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Oranos, moves one more stack.

{Basic Vortex}

A vortex instantly sweeps the 2 friendly stacks nearest to the target hex to the hexes around it. War machines are not affected.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Oranos, moves one more stack.

{Expert Vortex}

A vortex instantly sweeps the 5 friendly stacks nearest to the target hex to the hexes around it. War machines are not affected.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Oranos, moves one more stack.

{Vortex}

A vortex instantly sweeps the 2 friendly stacks nearest to the target hex to the hexes around it. War machines are not affected.
{Affinity}: when cast by a hero whose patron god is Kronos or Oranos, moves one more stack.
